@token = your-token-here
@password = your-password-here

### 测试 POST 请求
POST http://localhost:8080/hello
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test"
}
###
### 测试不传名字
POST http://localhost:8080/hello
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"   "}
### 检查应用到数据库的连接
GET http://localhost:8080/database-check
### 查询用户数量
GET http://localhost:8080/users/count

### 注册用户
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student02",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 用户名为空
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}
### 验证登录
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student01",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}
### 不携带令牌
GET http://localhost:8080/profile
### 携带令牌访问
GET http://localhost:8080/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### 测试无效令牌
GET http://localhost:8080/profile
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token
### 不带令牌创建笔记
POST http://localhost:8080/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "MyBatis 学习",
  "content": "学习 Mapper 如何执行 SQL"
}
### 携带令牌创建笔记
POST http://localhost:8080/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "chifan 学习",
  "content": "学习 chifan 如何执行 SQL"
}
### 查询我的笔记
GET http://localhost:8080/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询我的三号笔记
GET http://localhost:8080/notes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### 向 DeepSeek 提问
POST http://localhost:8080/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "我的学习代号是什么？"
}
### 比较两段文本的语义相似度
POST http://localhost:8080/embedding/similarity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "textA": "Java 接口定义了类需要实现的方法",
  "textB": "今天晚上准备吃火锅"
}
### 创建笔记并生成向量
POST http://localhost:8080/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "向量检索测试",
  "content": "向量检索可以根据语义相似度查找相关内容。"
}
###
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
"username": "student01",
"password": "{{password}}"
}

### 测试文件上传
POST http://localhost:8080/notes/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="upload-test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< D:/Projects/mySecondProject/ai-study-assistant/upload-test.txt
--MyBoundary--